---
description: GitHub pull request body headings
alwaysApply: true
---

When creating GitHub pull request bodies (including via `gh pr create`), use these section headings:

- `## Summary`
- `## Screenshots` (when the PR has UI screenshots; upload with `gh --attach`)
- `## Testing This PR`

Do not use `## Test plan` or `## Test Plan`. Prefer `## Testing This PR` whenever a testing/checklist section is included.
